WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.070
(gentle music)

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:03.860
- [Narrator] In India's
capital city of New Delhi,

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:06.970
you'll find a cultural mix
of history and modernity.

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:08.440
At the heart of this intersection,

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.940
we find vendors who are
serving amazing dishes

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.290
to this city of 25 million people,

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.940
and who aren't afraid
to mess with tradition.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:19.277
Starting with a classic,
stuffed with a twist.

00:00:19.277 --> 00:00:21.860
(upbeat music)

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:23.040
- [Narrator] Keeping with the theme,

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.370
here's an ice cream shop
that serves its dessert

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:27.078
in a slightly different manner.

00:01:27.078 --> 00:01:29.661
(upbeat music)

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:17.940
- [Narrator] On the west side of the city

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:21.138
there is a one-of-a-kind dish
elevating vegetarian food.

00:02:21.138 --> 00:02:23.721
(gentle music)

00:03:21.142 --> 00:03:22.261
- [Narrator] Finally, if you venture

00:03:22.261 --> 00:03:23.610
into the older part of the city,

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:25.720
you'll find this traditional fruit stand,

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.753
serving up an inspired snack.

00:03:27.753 --> 00:03:30.336
(upbeat music)

00:04:18.067 --> 00:04:20.650
(logo chiming)

